{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B36ThemeListItemComponentTokensProviderC","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider"}],"symbolKind":"class","roleHeading":"Class","title":"OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/AllListItemComponentTokensProvider","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/19OUDSTokensComponent08ListItemB6TokensP","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/TokensProvider"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/init(sizes:borders:colors:spaces:opacities:dimensions:)"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/borders","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/colors","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/dimensions","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/opacities","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/sizes","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/spaces"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/ListItemComponentTokens-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/TokensProvider-Implementations"],"generated":true}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemelistitemcomponenttokensprovider"]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider"},"abstract":[{"text":"A class which wraps all ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component tokens"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" for list item components like ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSListItem","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSSmallListItem","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This provider should be integrated as a ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllListItemComponentTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" implementation inside ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" so as to provide","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" implementation to use.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Custom themes can use subclass of ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider","type":"reference"},{"text":" and apply the provider they need.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It implements also the protocol ","type":"text"},{"code":"ListItemComponentTokens","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" so as to expose the component tokens for list item components through any ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Such component tokens are defined with raw and semantic tokens of sizes (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"borders (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), colors (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"spaces (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), opacities (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllOpacitySemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and dimensions (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllDimensionSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"code":["    \/\/ Define your own provider for list item component tokens","    \/\/ by inheriting from existing provider","    class CustomListItemComponentTokensProvider: OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider {","","        \/\/ Then override the list item component tokens you want.","","        override var sizeMinHeightDefault: SizeSemanticToken { DimensionRawTokens._750 }","","        override var colorBgCurrentFocus: MultipleColorSemanticToken { colors.actionSupportFocus }","","        override var spaceRowGap: SpaceSemanticToken { spaces.rowGapNone }","","        \/\/ ...","    }","","    \/\/ Or define your own provider from scratch","    class CustomListItemComponentTokensProvider: ListItemComponentTokens {","","        \/\/ And implement all tokens.","        \/\/ You are allowed to give semantic tokens providers if you want to define values.","    }"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then, you can give this "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CustomListItemComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" to your own theme implementation:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["class LocalTheme: OrangeTheme {","","    override init() {","        super.init(listItem: CustomListItemComponentTokensProvider())","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"or to an already existing theme for example:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    OrangeTheme(listItem: CustomListItemComponentTokensProvider())"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is also possible to use your own semantic tokens providers for this component tokens provider:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    \/\/ Uses by default here:","    \/\/ - OrangeThemeSizeSemanticTokensProvider for sizes","    \/\/ - OrangeThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider for borders","    \/\/ - OrangeThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider for colors","    \/\/ - OrangeThemeSpaceSemanticTokensProvider for spaces","    \/\/ - OrangeThemeOpacitySemanticTokensProvider for opacities","    \/\/ - OrangeThemeDimensionSemanticTokensProvider for dimensions","    let listItemComponentTokensProvider = OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider()","","    \/\/ Or use your own semantic tokens providers (or only some)","    let listItemComponentTokensProvider = OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider(","                                              sizes: CustomSizeSemanticTokensProvider(),","                                              borders: CustomBorderSemanticTokensProvider(),","                                              colors: CustomColorSemanticTokensProvider(),","                                              spaces: CustomSpaceSemanticTokensProvider())"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3.0.0"}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside"}]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/19OUDSTokensComponent08ListItemB6TokensP":{"title":"OUDSTokensComponent.ListItemComponentTokens","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/19OUDSTokensComponent08ListItemB6TokensP","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider/sizes":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sizes"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract29AllSizeSemanticTokensProviderP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"}],"title":"sizes","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Provider of size semantic tokens to use for list item sizes"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/sizes","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemelistitemcomponenttokensprovider\/sizes","kind":"symbol"},"ic_theme_orange.png":{"alt":null,"type":"image","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider/opacities":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments"